WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.929 --> 00:00:07.470
There is the age-old saying that “ignorance
is bliss.”

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:12.710
It suggests that if you do not know something,
than you will not worry about it.

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:20.289
But in terms of dealing with life, this concept
is not possible for a human being to maintain.

00:00:20.289 --> 00:00:26.360
Complete ignorance may in fact be blissful,
but we as humans, have surpassed the ability

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:31.160
to be of the complete ignorance required for
such bliss.

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:36.860
Through evolution, we have come into higher
and complex consciousness.

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:42.550
We have come to be inquisitive and analytical
about the life around us.

00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:49.130
We are the manifestations of nature’s attempt
to reflexively comprehend itself.

00:00:49.130 --> 00:00:56.120
No human is exempt from this, and therefore
no human can posses the bliss associated with

00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:57.719
ignorance.

00:00:57.719 --> 00:01:04.280
Less cognizant beings like that of an insect
or a reptile can possibly abide by such a

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:11.150
concept, but we are no longer on the same
cognitive field as an insect or a reptile,

00:01:11.150 --> 00:01:13.470
so we cannot live like one.

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:20.890
Therefore, we must not buy into the easiness
or superficiality of human idiocy, for we

00:01:20.890 --> 00:01:27.060
are all of an intelligence that requires attention
and embracement.

00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:33.750
You must work to achieve your highest intellectual
capacity and resist being pulled down and

00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:38.930
diverted away from caring about the power
of your mind.

00:01:38.930 --> 00:01:45.850
The pursuit of higher awareness and intelligence
is the pursuit of humanity itself.

00:01:45.850 --> 00:01:52.140
And if you wish to be in touch with your humanity,
you must not neglect what makes you uniquely

00:01:52.140 --> 00:01:59.360
human; your ability to ask “why?” and
work and fight for answers.

00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:05.220
When we ignore this pursuit and neglect an
attempt to understand our being and the life

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:15.400
around it, we endure unawareness and lose
all chances of ever truly experiencing bliss.

